{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"The quiet of the chamber has assumed the character of a pressure, a negative space that defines itself solely through that which it excludes. Hegde stands in the corner, constituting a living error within the ledger of the Directorate, whilst Ramesh abides in the patience of one whose labor has been suspended by my poverty. I am unable to rest; the body demands fuel, but the purse retains only the remnants of tea and samosas, which are insufficient for the next meal. I must observe the tension between these two men, for in their stagnation resides the truth of my current existence: a state of affairs that has not yet resolved itself into action."}}],"created":1795128651,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":134,"prompt_tokens":191,"total_tokens":325,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-vmKg2FYVRVIz9vFvkR51diASLyoBvSqX","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":191,"prompt_ms":381.246,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.9960523560209422,"prompt_per_second":500.9888628339707,"predicted_n":134,"predicted_ms":3144.348,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.641714285714286,"predicted_per_second":42.29811712952892}}